	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Check who is streaming on Twitch and watch your favorite streams via Streamlink in VLC, IINA, or mpv.

## First-time setup

Run `twauth` once to connect your Twitch account. Your browser opens automatically and the activation code is copied to the clipboard.

## Keywords

- `tw &lt;query&gt;` searches for live channels and games
- `twtop` shows the top live streams
- `twgames` shows the top streamed games
- `twcover` preloads game covers</string>
